<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi courts sentenced seven French citizens to lengthy prison terms for Islamic State membership, including six life sentences, while security forces downed an unidentified drone over Baghdad with air defenses. Yazidi militia units linked to the PKK are disarming and joining the Iraqi army, and other militia groups have pledged to disarm by mid‑2027. The prime minister visited Damascus, dismissed four officers for allowing the PMF to desecrate a US flag, and announced a reshuffle of more than 50 posts amid disputes over Sinjar security and YBS integration under federal authority. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNWUx2TkFCNmEzdGdyRzBPS2o1dXVPSUUxUFFndkFpQmhraUxvZ1dpNGpzZERjbTFfSjVBYUJiTUdsdzVLOFEwT2RhWFRNSVYzTkNfWlp0LV9MQmNMUnFpSE5FVC1wWG1COW1YSGxGckltREZzaWFlR0FkMEpRUGFTR2VyTW1TNXhfdC1BMC1FT3JHZUxkT0dyZURsdTZQZ085SldkRDNVTXI5aER6SlZtUllHd1Y3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOeDJKUHdzbXB2am5BNmlYYnJsWlo3YjZSSGJBTlN5NVRNQkVJR2c5YUpIclBrYW9kaDkwcHZGYVcyS0N4X0I0UWtZblVndmRIaEVXSjNEYUw4ZE1Mc2pmVzIycWFwY2dCbnJLRWNwejFtMHNzQWpjYm9qZVZ3a2Zhdk1MLTI4cE42Q2ViQXdLV1RYV29GMlEyMnMyX0dfSEh3azVsMGdsV0VaT3l1Rm9wNXFOb3lBdElzME96a0h4d3IzTEF3ZXEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTFB0YlRMZ0U4eWxHbk1Qa2hRUzI0YWcxWFV5dmE5c3N3Yy1PQ21KZzM3anV4NWFtdGNieVhuaFk5U3Jub1M1?oc=5&quot;&gt;964media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQQVBzMHMxT0szSldydmdQMlBoamxDaEhHRFJWZHNhNEt2NWFTUGpnYlE3Z0hkYkVSVXpaV2xYamRHSVpsaTBYT1hwQ0swQVFHaENDYnJYbGVJSjZWVUhUUFBkQjJJY0E5Ylh0S